        <mxCell id="card_2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#FDE68A;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;spacingLeft=52;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 11.5px; color: #92400E;&quot;&gt;Write-Ahead &amp;amp; Cooldown (W+1)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #475569;&quot;&gt;• Pods log failures into Even buckets&lt;br/&gt;• 10s–70s cooldown buffer before first retry&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
